{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcf734812251be90dc34a90934c51503f69dca87ef2feae1beaf57a59d5c4e8f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7806075f39689a8018fc97c6f094a2cb885b5e82905553b563f6025a14b3204b",
      "text": "话说回来，难不成……你也是来加练的！？\n真少见啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dc8493055c21855bc94ef2475faa887ec4d116fe99cba36b36287039197749a",
      "text": "不，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e267be931e4a36838d078e04a507a3031e76961cc5b90afa6eb5948c73a4a69",
      "text": "……是啊，被你看穿了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118a5b977e1b8a9378c27c8fc5deaa070127d4d6b758863c9b8e0ccd5acce4fd",
      "text": "下次要上的音乐节目，\n有很多可爱的女孩子也会出演呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:892d9a3885559be2c7615b4fe217b6e257d3825f3fab1926880257685e385ff0",
      "text": "我也想表现得帅气一点，\n所以比平时更有干劲了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:831c7263ae903037ae61318933fcf264bc1cb4de8c192861d469c701bb62cd04",
      "text": "哇，你还是一如既往是个轻浮的搭讪狂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7246a9b2f0ba448a0695e6e968ae1454b0e7107f1429ba46947f3ecce4c0ef2f",
      "text": "呵呵。那我先去换衣服了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ad97e6fc401c075a751b79b2b8436c6ea2cc9ac3bb507419cb50d3fac92f69",
      "text": "（……冬马身上，有和我过去相似的地方。\n是因为这样吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bfeb95f867b282863857df75bfa2c39bfa2232cd4503a66cec3e695a3bdf06a",
      "text": "（待在一起的时候，总会像那时候一样，\n一不小心就跟着热血起来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a461967f01a10f919802d6d7dd0d3fe3d5439276ddad18f58e244eb0a6be800c",
      "text": "……在这么想的时候，就已经被影响到了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
